  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "DRIVE INTO THE GAME\nBilliards, ice hockey, air hockey, bowling, wallball,
    cornhole and cheese rolling retain their own rules and feel. Dock Diving, Keepaway,
    Curling and Base Jumping join twenty-five physical sports, including twelve-truck
    Terrier hurdle racing eight-truck Minefield Mattress Racing paired Wife Carrying,
    Musical Parking, Giant Swing, Buzkashi, Bog Snorkelling Bungee Demolition, Fishing,
    Sumo, Target Launch, Field Goal and Beer Pong. Keepaway offers Arena View and
    First Person. Choose a sport, set names/colors/devices and start. Every sport
    has a complete HOW TO PLAY screen.\n\nOFFLINE INPUT\nUse separate controllers,
    independent keyboard clusters, AI, or share one controller\u2019s left/right
    sticks where offered. A whole controller has one owner; separate sticks can have
    separate owners. Action bindings are shown per participant. Opposite throttle
    brakes before reversing.\n\nPAUSE / RECONNECT\nEsc or assigned Start pauses.
    Disconnected sources preserve the match; reconnect or explicitly replace them,
    release controls and freshly confirm. Rematches retain the setup. Shared settings
    control audio, display, steering sensitivity and vibration.\n\nNo online services
    or accounts required."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
